#
# Counter-example for the awareness-subject-range invariant, enforced explicitly
# (INHABITED-RUNTIME-STACK.md): a gmeow:ModelDeployment is a logic:Relator and
# MUST NOT also be a gmeow:Agent — otherwise it could be attached as a
# gmeow:awarenessSubject (which ranges over gmeow:Agent), collapsing the
# deployment onto its serving-mode tenure. gmeow:ModelDeploymentShape carries an
# sh:not [ sh:class gmeow:Agent ]; because purrdf's sh:class is literal, this
# fixture types the deployment directly gmeow:Agent so the disjointness fires
# without relying on inference. Native SHACL MUST reject it with
# shacl.NotConstraintComponent.

@prefix gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/> .
@prefix ex:    <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/examples/model-serving/tests/> .

ex:deploymentIsAgent a gmeow:ModelDeployment ,
        gmeow:Agent .   # <-- a deployment typed an Agent trips sh:not [ sh:class gmeow:Agent ]
